{
    "title": "Kinzoo: Fun All-Ages Messenger",
    "description": "Kinzoo is more than a messenger\u2014it's where memories are made. Kids, parents and extended family come together on this single private platform\u2014sharing experiences that wouldn't otherwise exist. This is a trusted introduction to technology that eases the screen time struggle by giving kids a constructive, skill-building outlet to connect, create and cultivate passions. And, it's a way for kids to deepen social relationships with friends, preparing them to respect others, think critically and be good digital citizens when they grow up.\r\n\r\nThis all-in-one chat app is designed for ages 6+ and enables you to safely make video calls, exchange pictures, text messages and videos with chosen family and friends\u2014all without the need for a phone number.\r\n\r\nSCREEN TIME WELL SPENT\r\nEvery feature in Kinzoo is designed to promote our Three C's: connection, creativity and cultivation. This ensures that screen time is engaging, productive and enriching for kids and families. Check out the latest interactive stories and activities in the Paths Center and buy in-chat mini games, photo and video filters and sticker packs in the Marketplace to make messaging even more engaging and fun.\r\n\r\nBUILT FOR SAFETY\r\nWe believe kids should be able to experience the best of technology\u2014without exposure to the worst of it. That's why we built Kinzoo from the ground up for kids and their parents, prioritizing safety, privacy and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nHEALTHY TECHNOLOGY\r\nKinzoo is free from manipulative features and persuasive design. There are no \"likes,\" no followers, and no targeted ads. It\u2019s a safer space online that puts you\u2014and your whole family\u2014back in control of your digital identities.\r\n\r\nCREATING BETTER CONNECTIONS\r\nWe\u2019ve built Kinzoo for you and your family. Every day we\u2019re working to build experiences that bring you closer together, spur your creativity and inspire you to cultivate new passions. Connect with us on social media and help us to grow Kinzoo into the world\u2019s most trusted platform for family communication.\r\n\r\nInstagram: @kinzoofamily\r\nTwitter: @kinzoofamily\r\nFacebook: facebook.com/kinzoofamily",
    "descriptionHTML": "Kinzoo is more than a messenger\u2014it&#39;s where memories are made. Kids, parents and extended family come together on this single private platform\u2014sharing experiences that wouldn&#39;t otherwise exist. This is a trusted introduction to technology that eases the screen time struggle by giving kids a constructive, skill-building outlet to connect, create and cultivate passions. And, it&#39;s a way for kids to deepen social relationships with friends, preparing them to respect others, think critically and be good digital citizens when they grow up.<br><br>This all-in-one chat app is designed for ages 6+ and enables you to safely make video calls, exchange pictures, text messages and videos with chosen family and friends\u2014all without the need for a phone number.<br><br>SCREEN TIME WELL SPENT<br>Every feature in Kinzoo is designed to promote our Three C&#39;s: connection, creativity and cultivation. This ensures that screen time is engaging, productive and enriching for kids and families. Check out the latest interactive stories and activities in the Paths Center and buy in-chat mini games, photo and video filters and sticker packs in the Marketplace to make messaging even more engaging and fun.<br><br>BUILT FOR SAFETY<br>We believe kids should be able to experience the best of technology\u2014without exposure to the worst of it. That&#39;s why we built Kinzoo from the ground up for kids and their parents, prioritizing safety, privacy and peace of mind.<br><br>HEALTHY TECHNOLOGY<br>Kinzoo is free from manipulative features and persuasive design. There are no &quot;likes,&quot; no followers, and no targeted ads. It\u2019s a safer space online that puts you\u2014and your whole family\u2014back in control of your digital identities.<br><br>CREATING BETTER CONNECTIONS<br>We\u2019ve built Kinzoo for you and your family. Every day we\u2019re working to build experiences that bring you closer together, spur your creativity and inspire you to cultivate new passions. Connect with us on social media and help us to grow Kinzoo into the world\u2019s most trusted platform for family communication.<br><br>Instagram: @kinzoofamily<br>Twitter: @kinzoofamily<br>Facebook: facebook.com/kinzoofamily",
